  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add plugin subsystem and init refactors:\n      - Introduce a plugin system and adjust initialization flow across core components.\n      - Adds a new LuciferPlugin class that discovers types annotated with [PluginAttribute], caches them, and exposes AddPlugins/GetPlugins APIs with LifetimePlugin (Singleton/Transient) support.\n      - Exposes new helper methods on Lucifer (AddPluginsSingleton, AddPluginsTransient, GetPlugins) and ensures the LuciferPlugin static ctor runs at startup.\n      - Refactors static initializers: LuciferDLL now wires AssemblyResolve before initialization to allow resolving assemblies from a plugins folder, LuciferCMD and LuciferDLL use small ScanInternal helpers for eager scanning, and LuciferConfig now loads environment variables from a .lucifercore file before loading config properties. Also adds LifetimePlugin enum to LuciferModel.",
